ery bootstrap installs a Go toolchain at or above the module's declared floor so the GOTOOLCHAIN=local probe can compile, or (b) the chaos-disconnect classifier refuses to score OK when the start log carries a build/toolchain refusal — 'go.mod requires go >=', 'command not found', 'no Go files in' must yield UNVERIFIED with that line quoted, never OK.\nProve with a fresh agent battery at 6546b59e00cce3085e1a003bbfe736c0f51db379: the chaos-disconnect detail either contains a real disconnect fast-fail trace from a started process, or reads UNVERIFIED naming the toolchain cause. Also keep GOTOOLCHAIN=local (the no-download intent is correct).\nREJECTS: editing the evidence row by hand; declaring the product healthy from a probe that never compiled; widening the go.mod floor to match the old bootstrap go.","detail":{"fingerprint":"b7d533a4ff2d6b4b230e0489c438c348b757219fd63af9d5cd99c5112d076688","evidence":[{"run_id":"off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03","ts":"2026-11-04T19:14:42Z","tree_fp":"a8a792fb66ce4aba5fbc7311da658b10ccc391baf2c78fb1df6c141f15019288","artifacts":["/home/kara/.hermes/cache/scratch/off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03/qa-evidence.jsonl"]},{"run_id":"off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03","ts":"2026-11-04T19:15:22Z","tree_fp":"a8a792fb66ce4aba5fbc7311da658b10ccc391baf2c78fb1df6c141f15019288","artifacts":["/home/kara/.hermes/cache/scratch/off-by-one-qa-2026-11-04-18-30-03/qa-evidence.jsonl"]}]}}
